{
  "uid": "portability-traceability",
  "title": "Portability — Traceability (Throughput → Traces → Logs)",
  "description": "Ordem fixa de investigação: (1) saúde (2) throughput/erros (3) outcomes de negócio (4) worker/backlog (5) latência (6) traces Tempo (7) logs Loki/stdout (8) saturação. Contadores operacionais — verdade financeira = Postgres + operation_events. Author: Douglas Morais.",
  "tags": ["portability", "lab", "otel", "traceability"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "time": { "from": "now-30m", "to": "now" },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "README Observabilidade",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/mrdouglasmorais/Payroll-Portability-Platform---Case/blob/main/docs/architecture/observability.md",
      "targetBlank": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Explore Tempo",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/explore?orgId=1&left=%7B%22datasource%22:%22tempo%22%7D",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "portability-api,central-simulator",
        "current": { "text": "portability-api", "value": "portability-api" },
        "options": [
          { "text": "portability-api", "value": "portability-api", "selected": true },
          { "text": "central-simulator", "value": "central-simulator", "selected": false }
        ],
        "includeAll": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "0 · Como investigar (ordem obrigatória)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Rastreabilidade — roteiro",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Passo | O quê olhar | Onde | Próximo salto |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| **1** | Serviços UP? | Stats abaixo | Se DOWN → Compose/health |\n| **2** | Throughput + HTTP erros | Seção 2 | Pico/queda → correlacionar horário |\n| **3** | Outcomes `created/confirmed/rejected` | Seção 3 | `rejected` ≠ falha técnica |\n| **4** | Backlog / exhausted / stale fence | Seção 4 | Exhausted → `REQUIRES_REVIEW` |\n| **5** | Latência P95 API + client Central | Seção 5 | Spike → Tempo |\n| **6** | Trace `portability.job` (API→Central) | Seção 6 Tempo | Copiar **traceId** |\n| **7** | Logs do mesmo `traceId` / `operationId` | Seção 7 ou `docker compose logs … \\| rg traceId` | Eventos ECS (`central.call.failed`, …) |\n| **8** | Heap / Hikari | Seção 8 | Saturação vs bug de domínio |\n\n**IDs:** `operationId` / `jobId` só em MDC/spans — **não** em labels de métrica. Auditoria oficial = `operation_events`."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1 · Saúde",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "API RPS (não-actuator)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "decimals": 2 } },
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value" },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count{application=\"portability-api\",uri!~\".*/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "HTTP 5xx rate (API)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 4, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.01 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.1 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count{application=\"portability-api\",status=~\"5..\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Jobs backlog OPEN",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 20 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "portability_jobs_backlog{state=\"open\"}" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Jobs exhausted",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 1 }, { "color": "red", "value": 3 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "portability_jobs_backlog{state=\"exhausted\"}" }]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Central fail rate",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 0.05 }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.5 }] }
        }
      },
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background" },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum(rate(portability_central_failures_total[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Confirmed (rate)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3 } },
      "options": { "graphMode": "area", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum(rate(portability_operations_total{outcome=\"confirmed\"}[$__rate_interval])) or vector(0)"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2 · Throughput & erros HTTP (RED)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by status (API)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count{application=\"portability-api\",uri!~\".*/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by URI (API top)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean"] } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "topk(8, sum by (uri) (rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count{application=\"portability-api\",uri!~\".*/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
        "legendFormat": "{{uri}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP client → Central (rate by status)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_client_requests_milliseconds_count{application=\"portability-api\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Central-simulator inbound rate by status",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 15, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_count{application=\"central-simulator\",uri!~\".*/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "3 · Outcomes de negócio (não-autoritativos)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 29 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "portability_operations_total by outcome (rate)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(portability_operations_total[$__rate_interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Central failures by class (rate)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "sum by (class) (rate(portability_central_failures_total[$__rate_interval]))",
        "legendFormat": "{{class}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "4 · Worker / jobs (lease & fence)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 38 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Claims / stale fence / exhausted (rate)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 39 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "rate(portability_jobs_claimed_total[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "claimed" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "rate(portability_jobs_stale_fence_total[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "stale_fence" },
        { "refId": "C", "expr": "rate(portability_jobs_exhausted_total[$__rate_interval])", "legendFormat": "exhausted" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Job duration P95 (portability.job Observation)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 39 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(portability_job_milliseconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
        "legendFormat": "p95"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Backlog gauge (open vs exhausted)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 47 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 25, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "portability_jobs_backlog",
        "legendFormat": "{{state}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "5 · Latência",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 54 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP server P95 by URI (API)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 55 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, uri) (rate(http_server_requests_milliseconds_bucket{application=\"portability-api\",uri!~\".*/actuator.*\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
        "legendFormat": "{{uri}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HTTP client P95 → Central",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 55 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, uri) (rate(http_client_requests_milliseconds_bucket{application=\"portability-api\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
        "legendFormat": "{{uri}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "6 · Traces (Tempo) — ponte métrica → span",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 63 }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como abrir o trace certo",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 64 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. Explore → **Tempo**\n2. TraceQL:\n```\n{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && name=\"portability.job\"}\n```\n3. Abra o span → confira filhos HTTP na Central\n4. Copie **traceId** → seção 7 / stdout\n\nRetries 503 devem aparecer como tentativas no mesmo fluxo de correlação (`correlationId` + spans)."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "TraceQL search — portability.job (recent)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 64 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
        "queryType": "traceql",
        "limit": 20,
        "tableType": "traces",
        "query": "{resource.service.name=\"$service\" && name=\"portability.job\"}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "title": "Service map (Prometheus ← Tempo)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 76 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
        "queryType": "serviceMap"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "7 · Logs (correlação por traceId / event)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 86 }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Logs ECS no stdout (fonte operacional)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 87 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Apps **não** exportam logs via OTLP (ADR-014). Fonte = stdout JSON ECS.\n\n```bash\ndocker compose logs portability-api | rg '\"event\"'\ndocker compose logs portability-api | rg '<traceId>'\ndocker compose logs portability-api | rg '<operationId>'\n```\n\nEventos: `portability.created`, `central.submit.accepted`, `central.call.failed`, `portability.confirmed|rejected`, `job.exhausted`…"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Loki — service_name (se houver ingestão)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 87 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": false, "showCommonLabels": false, "wrapLogMessage": true, "prettifyLogMessage": false, "enableLogDetails": true, "sortOrder": "Descending" },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
        "expr": "{service_name=~\"$service|otelcol-.*\"}",
        "queryType": "range"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "8 · Saturação (USE)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 99 }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "HikariCP active connections",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 100 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "hikaricp_connections_active",
        "legendFormat": "{{application}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM heap used",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 100 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"}",
        "legendFormat": "{{application}}"
      }]
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "JVM threads live",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 100 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "spanNulls": true } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" } },
      "targets": [{
        "refId": "A",
        "expr": "jvm_threads_live",
        "legendFormat": "{{application}}"
      }]
    }
  ]
}
